          'ACTGCCTGGCTGAAATTTAACCCGGAAACCGCGAAAGAGATCGAGTGAAAAGTACGTGAGTTGCTGC'
          'TGAGCAACCCGAACTCAACGCCGGATTTCTCTGTAGATGATAGCGAAGGCGTAGCAGAAACTAACGA'
